    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know therapy is a suggestion but it just feels like more work for everyone else. like another thing they have to manage or pay for. i look at them and all i see is the life they could be living if i wasn't constantly needing something or taking up their time. it feels like my being here is just a subtraction from their happiness.",
