      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it just feels so selfish to keep pretending it gets better when it doesn't. it feels like the most selfless thing i could actually do is just stop being part of the equation. like, if i wasn't here, they could finally breathe and start their own lives without constantly looking back to check on me.",
